# Cloudflare Web Analytics token.
#
# Set this in Vercel (Project → Settings → Environment Variables) for the
# Production environment only. Leave it unset locally and on preview
# deployments so they send no analytics data — Analytics.astro renders nothing
# without it.
#
# Get the token from Cloudflare → Web Analytics → your site → the JS snippet:
# it is the value of "token" inside the data-cf-beacon attribute.
PUBLIC_CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN=
